      "weather": "FINE",
      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FADE TO BLACK (6) was strongly supported last start when a short priced favourite and duly saluted winning by 11 lengths at this track in a handy 25.16. Awkwardly drawn but goes well at this distance. Winner at his latest appearance in the quickest time on the card. Shapes as a top winning chance on latest effort. BAD AND BERTHA (2) was strongly fancied last time on the back of some good recent form but could only manage second (25.63) at this track. Solid formlines coming through her last run. Well placed and gets her chance. WEBLEC WHISTLER (1) is a talented type and proved too strong last time to win by half a length at Q Parklands in a handy 30.27 beating Hocking. Good beginner assisted by the inside draw. Deserves serious consideration again. BIG EASY AL (3) is a chance after winning last time.",
